  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing resilience of the Pacific SIDS through science and partnership building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guided by the SIDS Accelerated Modalities of Action (SAMOA) Pathway and its new framework which will be adopted in 2024 during the SIDS conference, this activity will contribute to reinforce the capacities for resilience of the Pacific SIDS communities. Given the region&#x2019;s extreme vulnerability to climate change and natural disasters, as well as other environmental, social and economic challenges of the Pacific populations, the activity will respond effectively to emerging needs and priorities at national and regional levels. This activity will contribute to the SIDS Operational Strategy and its Accelerators, and will be strongly linked with SC programme priorities as well as other programme objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
